<title>USA: Sierra Health wins Medicare rate hikes.</title>
<headline>Sierra Health wins Medicare rate hikes.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sierra Health Services Inc said Monday it had won rate hikes for 1997 Medicare reimbursements in several of its operating regions.</p>
<p>The rate hikes, awarded by the Healthcare Financing Administration, include 6.0 percent in southern Nevada, about 8.0 percent in the Houston area, and 4.0 percent in northern Nevada, it said.</p>
<p>Sierra shares were up 1-1/8 to 32-1/4 at mid-morning.</p>
</text>
